Mitosis and Cell Division: Academic Study Guide
An academic learning resource covering mitosis and the stages of cell division

This study guide should cover:
- Overview of the cell cycle
- Prophase: Chromatin condensation, nuclear envelope breakdown
- Metaphase: Chromosome alignment at metaphase plate
- Anaphase: Sister chromatid separation and poleward movement
- Telophase: Nuclear envelope reformation, decondensation
- Cytokinesis: Division of cytoplasm and organelles

Include diagrams, key terms, and review questions.

Save as: Mitosis_Study_Guide.pdf in assets/documents/